WEBVTT

00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:05.093
(GASPING)

00:00:05.176 --> 00:00:07.345
Oh, not now! Come on, come on!

00:00:07.428 --> 00:00:09.180
I'm so close!

00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:12.851
VOICE: (DISTANTLY) Luca!

00:00:15.478 --> 00:00:16.646
Just stay right there!

00:00:16.729 --> 00:00:17.730
Alberto.

00:00:17.814 --> 00:00:19.149
I'm coming for you!

00:00:19.774 --> 00:00:21.317
What's wrong, piccoletto?

00:00:21.401 --> 00:00:23.069
Afraid of a little rain?

00:00:23.153 --> 00:00:24.154
ALBERTO: Hey!
ERCOLE: Huh?

00:00:24.904 --> 00:00:27.157
For the last time,
you two don't belong here.

00:00:27.323 --> 00:00:29.033
Get out of my town!

00:00:29.117 --> 00:00:30.160
(GRUNTS)

00:00:30.243 --> 00:00:31.244
(GROANS)

00:00:32.871 --> 00:00:34.747
-(GASPS)
-(LAUGHS)

00:00:34.831 --> 00:00:37.208
(YELPS) Sea monster! Right there!

00:00:37.292 --> 00:00:38.334
Huh?

00:00:38.418 --> 00:00:39.502
Mamma mia!

00:00:39.586 --> 00:00:41.754
Ciccio! My harpoon! Veloce!

00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:43.631
(PANTS, GASPS)

00:00:44.924 --> 00:00:47.927
-LUCA: Alberto...
-No, stop! Just stay there.

00:00:49.262 --> 00:00:50.388
You're still okay.

00:00:51.014 --> 00:00:53.308
-Andiamo!
-Alberto, wait!

00:00:54.976 --> 00:00:56.811
(GRUNTING)

00:00:56.895 --> 00:00:58.021
No!

00:01:00.607 --> 00:01:01.608
(GRUNTS)

00:01:02.984 --> 00:01:05.028
(EXCLAIMS IN ITALIAN)

00:01:05.111 --> 00:01:07.322
(SOFT DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING)

00:01:16.164 --> 00:01:17.332
ERCOLE: (YELPS) What?

00:01:17.665 --> 00:01:19.918
Whoa! You really are crazy!

00:01:20.001 --> 00:01:21.753
Learned it from you!

00:01:21.836 --> 00:01:23.338
Let's get to the water!

00:01:24.589 --> 00:01:26.007
No! Ciccio!

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:27.091
Here it is.

00:01:28.259 --> 00:01:29.969
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

00:01:31.763 --> 00:01:33.389
-(KID YELPS)
-Hey there.

00:01:33.473 --> 00:01:34.641
-(WHIMPERS)
-Excuse us.

00:01:34.724 --> 00:01:37.185
-Out of the way! Via, via!
-(YELPS)

00:01:44.567 --> 00:01:46.110
(CROWD EXCLAIMING)

00:01:47.153 --> 00:01:48.154
ERCOLE: Ha-ha!

00:01:49.405 --> 00:01:50.865
-(YELPS)
-(ERCOLE GRUNTS)

00:01:51.324 --> 00:01:52.325
Luca!

00:01:52.408 --> 00:01:53.993
(BOTH YELPING)

00:01:54.077 --> 00:01:55.078
(GRUNTS)

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:56.621
-(CAT YOWLS)
-(WOMAN SCREAMS)

00:01:56.704 --> 00:01:58.706
-LUCA: Sorry!
-(BOTH YELLING)

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:03.419
(BOTH SCREAM)

00:02:06.339 --> 00:02:07.882
-Oh, no! Luca!
-LORENZO: Son!

00:02:10.426 --> 00:02:12.595
You should've left when I told you.

00:02:12.679 --> 00:02:15.723
Now, I gotta kill some sea monsters!

00:02:15.807 --> 00:02:17.350
(ERCOLE LAUGHS EVILLY)

00:02:17.433 --> 00:02:20.103
So long, evil empire of injustice.

00:02:20.562 --> 00:02:21.980
-(GRUNTS)
-(ERCOLE YELPS)

00:02:22.063 --> 00:02:23.523
(CROWD GASPING)

00:02:24.816 --> 00:02:26.609
-No!
-(GRUNTS)

00:02:26.693 --> 00:02:27.944
-(GASPS)
-Giulia!

00:02:33.825 --> 00:02:36.119
Mostri marini! Give me that!

00:02:36.202 --> 00:02:37.412
(WOMAN GASPS)

00:02:37.495 --> 00:02:38.913
Giulia. Are you all right?

00:02:38.997 --> 00:02:41.666
(CHUCKLES) Yeah. Yeah. I'm... I'm okay.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.751
Thanks, guys. (GASPS)

00:02:44.544 --> 00:02:45.837
(GASPS) Giulietta?

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.088
Papà! I...

00:02:50.258 --> 00:02:52.177
-(CROWD CLAMORING)
-MAN: Look at that!

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:53.553
You're not going anywhere. Come on.

00:02:53.636 --> 00:02:56.473
I saw them first! The reward is mine!

00:02:57.015 --> 00:02:58.099
We're not afraid of you!

00:02:58.183 --> 00:03:00.310
No, but we're afraid of you.

00:03:00.393 --> 00:03:03.480
Everyone is horrified
and disgusted by you,

00:03:03.563 --> 00:03:05.440
because you are monsters.

00:03:05.523 --> 00:03:07.150
Stop! They are not monsters.

00:03:07.233 --> 00:03:09.152
Oh, yeah? Who are they, then?

00:03:09.235 --> 00:03:10.945
MASSIMO: I know who they are.

00:03:20.705 --> 00:03:23.416
They are Luca and Alberto,

00:03:24.918 --> 00:03:26.002
and...

00:03:26.878 --> 00:03:29.631
they are the winners.

00:03:29.964 --> 00:03:31.382
(CROWD EXCLAIMING)

00:03:31.466 --> 00:03:33.426
-Luca!
-Let us through!

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:34.511
-What?
-Really?

00:03:34.594 --> 00:03:36.805
They can't be the winners.
They are not even people!

00:03:36.888 --> 00:03:38.223
Signora Marsigliese?

00:03:39.891 --> 00:03:42.477
Technically, legally,

00:03:42.977 --> 00:03:44.020
yes, they won.

00:03:44.103 --> 00:03:45.647
-(CROWD GASPING)
-We won?

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.857
Who cares if they won?
They are sea monsters.

00:03:47.941 --> 00:03:49.818
-(FISHERMAN GROANS)
-(SPEAKS ITALIAN)

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:51.861
(MASSIMO CLEARS THROAT)

00:03:53.404 --> 00:03:55.532
-(SIGHS) Andiamo.
-WOMAN: Hmm.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.325
(GRUMBLES IN ITALIAN)

00:03:57.408 --> 00:03:58.660
(MEN GROAN)

00:03:58.743 --> 00:03:59.744
What? Come on!

00:03:59.828 --> 00:04:00.829
-Hey!
-GIULIA: Ha!

00:04:00.912 --> 00:04:02.622
Ciccio! Guido! Another harpoon.

00:04:03.414 --> 00:04:07.168
Ah, idioti! Be useful for once
in your pathetic lives.

00:04:07.794 --> 00:04:09.420
-Guido.
-Ciccio.

00:04:11.089 --> 00:04:13.091
-(CICCIO AND GUIDO GRUNT)
-(YELPS, WHIMPERS)

00:04:13.716 --> 00:04:15.593
-Oops.
-(BLOWS RASPBERRIES)

00:04:15.677 --> 00:04:17.929
(CRYING) No, piccolino.

00:04:18.304 --> 00:04:20.265
It's over, the reign of terror.

00:04:20.348 --> 00:04:21.808
It's finally over!

00:04:21.891 --> 00:04:23.309
DANIELA: Luca!
LORENZO: Luca!

00:04:23.393 --> 00:04:24.727
(CROWD GASPING)

00:04:24.811 --> 00:04:26.938
You had us worried half to death,
and you must never do that again!

00:04:27.021 --> 00:04:28.022
LUCA: I'm sorry.

00:04:28.106 --> 00:04:31.025
And you raced your little tail off
and kicked so much human butt!

00:04:31.109 --> 00:04:34.154
And I'm so proud of you,
and I am so mad at you!

00:04:34.237 --> 00:04:35.321
(DANIELA CRYING)

00:04:35.405 --> 00:04:36.781
I love you, Mom.

00:04:36.948 --> 00:04:37.949
Son.

00:04:42.328 --> 00:04:44.080
Signore e signori,

00:04:44.164 --> 00:04:47.542
the winners of this year's Portorosso Cup,

00:04:48.001 --> 00:04:49.294
the underdogs.

00:04:49.377 --> 00:04:51.546
-Wow.
-(ALL EXCLAIM IN AWE)

00:04:51.671 --> 00:04:53.381
-Wow.
-Yeah!

00:04:53.965 --> 00:04:55.300
LUCA: I can't believe we won!
ALBERTO: We won!

00:04:55.383 --> 00:04:56.759
GIULIA: Yes! Underdogs!

00:04:56.843 --> 00:04:58.511
-(KIDS LAUGHING)
-MAN: Ugh.

00:04:59.053 --> 00:05:00.180
(BOTH GRUNT)

00:05:01.181 --> 00:05:03.016
(CROWD GASPING AND EXCLAIMING)

00:05:04.559 --> 00:05:06.102
-Give me that!
-Here.

00:05:06.478 --> 00:05:07.479
(GRUNTS)

00:05:07.979 --> 00:05:09.272
(CONGRATULATES IN ITALIAN)

00:05:09.355 --> 00:05:11.357
-(CROWD APPLAUDING)
-(KIDS CHEERING)

00:05:12.901 --> 00:05:13.943
GIULIA: We did it!

00:05:15.111 --> 00:05:16.237
BOY: They won!

00:05:18.156 --> 00:05:19.657
(ALBERTO WHOOPING)

00:05:19.741 --> 00:05:22.035
Feast your eyes on the greatest Vespa

00:05:22.118 --> 00:05:23.745
the world has ever seen!

00:05:23.828 --> 00:05:25.371
(KIDS LAUGH AND WHOOP)

00:05:26.206 --> 00:05:27.749
-(ENGINE SPUTTERS)
-Perfect.

00:05:27.832 --> 00:05:28.833
(ALL LAUGH)

00:05:29.292 --> 00:05:31.294
(MASSIMO SPEAKING ITALIAN)

00:05:32.962 --> 00:05:34.005
DANIELA: Mmm.

00:05:34.631 --> 00:05:36.508
-MASSIMO: Signora.
-Grazie.

00:05:36.591 --> 00:05:38.092
Mom! What are you doing here?

00:05:38.176 --> 00:05:40.178
I come to town most weekends.

00:05:40.261 --> 00:05:41.304
(KIDS WHOOP)

00:05:41.387 --> 00:05:42.680
You're not gonna catch me!
(LAUGHING)

00:05:42.764 --> 00:05:44.474
-Underdogs forever!
-ALBERTO: Whoo-hoo!

00:05:44.557 --> 00:05:49.395
(SIGHS) What he did today was amazing.

00:05:49.479 --> 00:05:51.981
But we can't let him stay in this world.

00:05:52.649 --> 00:05:53.650
Can we?

00:05:53.733 --> 00:05:56.402
Some people, they'll never accept him.

00:05:57.570 --> 00:05:59.280
-But some will.
-(LAUGHING)

00:05:59.364 --> 00:06:02.575
And he seems to know
how to find the good ones.

00:06:06.037 --> 00:06:07.622
So, where will you go first?

00:06:07.705 --> 00:06:09.541
We're gonna stick around here for a bit.

00:06:09.624 --> 00:06:12.585
We gotta fix this thing up
before we take it across the entire Earth.

00:06:12.669 --> 00:06:15.171
Okay. Just don't forget to pack.

00:06:15.255 --> 00:06:18.675
(GASPS) Santo Gorgonzola!
I need to pack! For school!

00:06:18.758 --> 00:06:22.804
Oh, yeah, school.
You're gonna learn so much.

00:06:22.887 --> 00:06:25.223
Um, I can leave you some books.

00:06:25.306 --> 00:06:26.516
You can?

00:06:26.808 --> 00:06:28.434
Come on, Alberto!

